# Who must review what. The last matching line wins, so the defaults come first.
# With "Require review from Code Owners" on (see GOVERNANCE.md), content paths need a content
# reviewer's approval; a maintainer's approval alone isn't enough for them.

# Everything: a maintainer.
*                                                        @adhkaar-app/maintainers

# Religious content: adhkaar, collections, daily reminders, meanings, audio, Hijri calendar.
/app/src/main/assets/**                                  @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers
/tools/reminders/**                                      @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers
/app/src/main/res/values*/strings_reminder_sources.xml   @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers
/docs/REMINDERS.md                                       @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers
/docs/i18n-template.json                                 @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers
/docs/AUDIO.md                                           @adhkaar-app/content-reviewers

# Project rules, CI and releases: maintainers only.
/.github/                                                @adhkaar-app/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md                                           @adhkaar-app/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                                             @adhkaar-app/maintainers
